@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<main aria-labelledby="EcoConnect">
    <h2 id="title">@ViewBag.Title</h2>
    <h3>@ViewBag.Message</h3>

    <p class="lead">
        EcoConnect is a community‑focused environmental organisation dedicated to promoting sustainable living,
        environmental awareness, and positive community action.
    </p>

    <p>Welcome to our website!</p>
    <p>
        We are an environmental charity dedicated to supporting and promoting environmental causes. Through this platform, we share and organise activities such as clean‑ups, workshops, and talks. We also encourage discussions on green topics, community meet‑ups, environmental news, and more.
        Get involved by participating, commenting on, and reviewing our activities. Together, we can make our local community, town, country, and planet a better place!
    </p>
</main>